WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.120
The first high heel ever
was a piece of military footwear.

00:00:09.440 --> 00:00:12.680
People in West Asia had been
tremendous horse riders,

00:00:12.760 --> 00:00:15.440
and that's how they fought, they rode
in the saddle and they stood up

00:00:15.520 --> 00:00:18.800
to shoot their bows and that meant
you need a heel to keep

00:00:18.880 --> 00:00:20.360
you in the stirrups, nice and stable.

00:00:20.440 --> 00:00:22.480
The Shah of Persia,
he's called Abbas the First,

00:00:22.560 --> 00:00:24.800
he sends off some emissaries
into Europe and they turn up

00:00:24.880 --> 00:00:26.280
wearing high heels
and everyone goes...

00:00:27.360 --> 00:00:32.200
...so suddenly this military clothing
becomes adopted in Europe.

00:00:41.720 --> 00:00:44.160
But it's a little bit later on,
in the early 1600s, that we start

00:00:44.240 --> 00:00:46.880
to see heels coming in,
and it starts with the blokes,

00:00:46.960 --> 00:00:49.840
it's for being manly and butch.
But what happens quite quickly

00:00:49.920 --> 00:00:52.760
is women start to emulate
male fashion, and part of that

00:00:52.840 --> 00:00:56.400
is they start wearing men's shoes.
The real big moment is when Louis XIV

00:00:56.480 --> 00:00:59.240
of France starts wearing heels,
because he's quite a small man,

00:00:59.320 --> 00:01:02.440
and he famously has red heels
- that Louboutin mirrored

00:01:02.520 --> 00:01:03.640
later on in the 20th Century.

00:01:03.720 --> 00:01:05.400
Suddenly everyone at the court
is wearing heels.

00:01:05.480 --> 00:01:07.440
Heels go through a bit
of an up and down history

00:01:07.520 --> 00:01:11.040
and the 1700s, philosophers are
talking about the rationalism of men,

00:01:11.360 --> 00:01:14.000
by contrast, women are said
to be emotional and sentimental

00:01:14.080 --> 00:01:17.040
and can't be trusted to do
important things like think.

00:01:17.120 --> 00:01:20.800
And so men are being advised
to wear rational shoes

00:01:20.880 --> 00:01:22.080
and high heels are not rational.

00:01:22.160 --> 00:01:25.280
The 1860s, this is when women's
heels start to become sexy.

00:01:25.360 --> 00:01:27.200
We have photography,
a brand new technology,

00:01:27.280 --> 00:01:29.360
and quite often
in pornography of this period,

00:01:29.440 --> 00:01:30.960
you're seeing women
still wearing their boots,

00:01:31.040 --> 00:01:33.760
their shoes with the heels on,
so it becomes erotic.

00:01:41.880 --> 00:01:45.360
Hollywood had a huge influence
on the rise of heels as the symbol

00:01:45.440 --> 00:01:48.360
of sexiness. In the 1950s,
Marilyn Monroe famously quoted,

00:01:48.440 --> 00:01:50.360
I can't think of the exact words
but she said you know...

00:01:52.960 --> 00:01:56.040
...she was speaking on behalf of
women. For Monroe, who was about

00:01:56.120 --> 00:01:59.760
glamour and beauty and sexiness,
she felt that that was an asset.

00:02:09.280 --> 00:02:11.760
People can tell whether women are
wearing high heels without actually

00:02:11.840 --> 00:02:14.400
seeing their feet, so it is that
posture, change in the gait.

00:02:14.480 --> 00:02:17.400
But a more recent study has shown
that actually it's changing the shape

00:02:17.480 --> 00:02:19.840
of the spine that is actually
the attractive thing.

00:02:23.400 --> 00:02:27.160
We looked at all the research on
high heels and they are not healthy,

00:02:27.240 --> 00:02:30.720
there was increased risk of
musculoskeletal conditions,

00:02:30.800 --> 00:02:32.760
bunions and pain.

00:02:54.120 --> 00:02:57.000
I think they're too iconic and too
much a part of aesthetics and imagery

00:02:57.080 --> 00:02:59.680
and history and power
and sex to ever go away,

00:02:59.760 --> 00:03:00.920
and I think they'll always be there.

00:03:01.000 --> 00:03:04.040
I'd rather go through quite a lot of
pain and wear them and look nice,

00:03:04.120 --> 00:03:05.760
and suffer for it, I think.

00:03:06.080 --> 00:03:09.120
I'm crazy about fashion,
I think we all are.

00:03:09.560 --> 00:03:12.480
And I think any smart woman
would go on wearing them,

00:03:12.560 --> 00:03:15.000
irrespective of what
the consequences are.

